      "1. Fit candidate models only on DEVELOPMENT.",
      "2. Internal development diagnostics may use grouped folds within DEVELOPMENT.",
      "3. Use VALIDATION only for bounded architecture/checkpoint selection.",
      "4. Once a final PF-002A checkpoint is selected, freeze it.",
      "5. Only then evaluate BENCHMARK_PILOT_ONLY exactly once.",
      "6. Do not return from benchmark result to architecture tuning."
    ],
    "bounded_architecture_search": "PF-002A architecture search must use a bounded candidate set frozen before validation outcomes are inspected. The validation cohort may not expand because a model performs poorly.",
